<html>
<head>
	<title>AI Agent Request Pending</title>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;height:auto;min-height:auto;">
<table bgcolor="#f5f7f5" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:#f5f7f5;" width="100%">
	
		<tr>
			<td align="center" style="padding:24px;">
			<table bgcolor="#ffffff" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:620px;max-width:100%;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e6e2;" width="620">
				
					<tr>
						<td bgcolor="#2f4233" style="background-color:#2f4233;padding:22px 28px;">
						<div style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#cbd8ce;font-weight:bold;">AI AGENT GOVERNANCE</div>

						<div style="font-size:22px;line-height:28px;color:#ffffff;font-weight:bold;padding-top:4px;">Agent Request Pending</div>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td style="padding:26px 28px 14px 28px;color:#242424;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;">Hello,<br />
						<br />
						The AI Agent request for <strong>{{{Case.AgentName__c}}}</strong> has been open for more than 30 days and is still not closed.<br />
						<br />
						Please review the request and complete the remaining actions.</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td style="padding:6px 28px 22px 28px;">
						<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#242424;" width="100%">
							
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;color:#6b746d;font-weight:bold;" width="180">Agent</td>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;">{{{Case.AgentName__c}}}</td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;color:#6b746d;font-weight:bold;">Request Type</td>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;">{{{Case.AI_Agent_Request_Type__c}}}</td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;color:#6b746d;font-weight:bold;">Current Status</td>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eeeeee;"><strong>{{{Case.AgentStatus__c}}}</strong></td>
								</tr>
								<tr>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;color:#6b746d;font-weight:bold;">Created On</td>
									<td style="padding:10px 0;">{{{Case.CreatedDate}}}</td>
								</tr>
							
						</table>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td bgcolor="#f1f5f2" style="background-color:#f1f5f2;padding:20px 28px;color:#242424;font-size:14px;line-height:21px;"><strong style="color:#2f4233;">Action required</strong><br />
						<br />
						Please check whether the request is still relevant and complete the review process. If no further action is required, the request should be closed.</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td style="padding:24px 28px 28px 28px;">
						<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
							
								<tr>
									<td bgcolor="#2f4233" style="background-color:#2f4233;padding:12px 20px;"><a href="{{{Case.Link}}}" style="color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px;font-weight:bold;">Open Agent Request</a></td>
								</tr>
							
						</table>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td style="border-top:1px solid #eeeeee;padding:16px 28px;color:#777777;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;">This is an automated reminder from the AI Agent Governance process.<br />
						<br />
						For any questions, contact <strong>dust@carmignac.com</strong>.<br />
						<br />
						Dust Admin Team<br />
						Carmignac AI Agent Governance</td>
					</tr>
				
			</table>
			</td>
		</tr>
	
</table>
</body>
</html>